# ColorSamples with NaN as an element of nRGB in an otherwise valid one-sample pair.
#
# A trailing Sphere follows AGENTS.md's "RIB authoring" section, "The
# desync convention." Not third-party.
Display "malformed_out.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
ColorSamples [ NaN 0 0 ] [ 1 1 1 ]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
